{"id":"26-4-2-6","zh":"1. 论破戒，","confidence":80}
{"id":"26-5-2-6","zh":"2. 论持戒的功德，","confidence":85}
{"id":"26-6-2-6","zh":"3. 论教诫，","confidence":80}
{"id":"26-7-2-6","zh":"4. 论住寺比丘的行仪，","confidence":65}
{"id":"26-8-2-6","zh":"5. 论资具的舍离，","confidence":55}
{"id":"26-9-2-6","zh":"6. 论波罗提木叉，","confidence":85}
